# This directory is a bind-mount target for the `git-server` docker
# service — it holds the seeded BARE repos only (see tests/integration/
# gitServerSeed.ts; the ephemeral clone workdir used to write the seed
# commit lives in the OS temp dir, never here — see that module's own doc
# comment for why). Contents are generated at test-setup time, not checked
# in — only this .gitignore keeps the directory itself tracked so a fresh
# checkout has the mount point ready before the first `docker compose up`.
*
!.gitignore
